/- Each chunk contains eight blocks of 64 consecutive masks. Each block packs its
   vertices and their three five-bit slots from low bits to high bits.
   Code zero is a diagonal. Codes one through fifteen add the corresponding bit in
   a row and remove it in a column. Code sixteen represents the edge from mask 15
   to mask 1023. In the column table, code seventeen denotes the exceptional row.
   Code thirty-one is unused. The exceptional row is given separately. -/

